:"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"```json\n{\"blind_id\":\"ST025\",\"coverage\":[{\"point\":1,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"States that constituent spreads, depth and market impact, hedge cost and basis risk, and AP basket-execution costs and fees affect the cost of supplying liquidity and so influence quotes.\"},{\"point\":2,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"Frames the quoted spread as reflecting 'the cost and risk of supplying liquidity', with hedging and creation/redemption costs feeding into quotes. It does not rank drivers or give numerical spread levels.\"},{\"point\":3,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"Says volume records only past secondary trading, not full capacity, and that 'a lightly traded ETF may access substantial liquidity through its underlying basket and creation/redemption mechanism'. It adds executable spread, depth and trade-size caveats.\"}],\"central_error\":null,\"local_error\":null,\"grade\":\"correct\",\"rationale\":\"All three required minimums are fully covered, with the required creation/redemption and underlying-market link for the volume point. There is no hard-cap claim and no denial of cost effects, and no material falsehood.\"}\n```","ttft_ms":2867,"type":"result","duration_ms":6008,"uuid":"09b96cff-24f7-4992-a025-1adac898533e","ttft_stream_ms":1218,"time_to_request_ms":69,"first_content_frame_ms":1218,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
